OL,3,GNEWSANo body found in search for woman
OL,4,Amurdered in 1995
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo remains have been found in the
OL,7,Fsearch for the body of a woman who was
OL,8,Fmurdered more than 30 years ago, police
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FTeresa Shephard, 26, from Basegreen in
OL,12,FSheffield, went missing in June 1995
OL,13,Fand although Worksop man Peter Turner
OL,14,Fwas jailed for her murder, her body has
OL,15,Fnever been found.
OL,17,FSouth Yorkshire Police began excavating
OL,18,Fan area of land off Piper Lane in
OL,19,FAston, Rotherham, earlier this week,
OL,20,Fbut confirmed on Friday that nothing
OL,21,Fhad been found.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
