OL,3,GNEWSANo body found in search for woman
OL,4,Amurdered in 1995
OL,5,
OL,6,FA force spokesperson added: "Teresa's
OL,7,Ffamily have been made aware of this
OL,8,Fupdate and our thoughts are with them
OL,9,Fas they continue to live with the
OL,10,Findescribable pain of not knowing where
OL,11,FTeresa's remains are."
